Verse 1:
[Eb]Lord, I want to be a [Bb]Chris[Eb]tian in my heart, in [Ab]my [Eb]heart,
[Eb]Lord, I want to be a [Bb]Chris[Cm]tian [Ab]in my [Eb]hea[Ab]rt.[Eb]
[Eb]In my [Ab]heart, in my [Eb]hea[Cm]rt,
[Eb]Lord, I want to be a [Bb]Chris[Cm]tian [Ab]in my [Eb]heart.

Verse 2:
[Eb]Lord, I [Bb]want to be [Eb]more loving [Ab]in my heart, [Eb]in my heart,
[Eb]Lord, [Bb]I want [Cm]to be [Ab]more loving [Eb]in my [Ab]heart, in [Eb]my heart.
[Eb]In [Ab]my heart, [Eb]in [Cm]my heart,
[Eb]Lord, I [Bb]want to be [Cm]more loving [Ab]in my heart, [Eb]in my heart.

Verse 3:
[Eb]Lord, I [Bb]want to be [Eb]more holy [Ab]in my heart, [Eb]in my heart,
[Eb]Lord, [Bb]I want [Cm]to be [Ab]more holy [Eb]in my [Ab]heart, in [Eb]my heart.
[Eb]In [Ab]my heart, [Eb]in [Cm]my heart,
[Eb]Lord, I [Bb]want to be [Cm]more holy [Ab]in my heart, [Eb]in my heart.

Verse 4:
[Eb]Lord, I [Bb]want to be [Eb]more like Jesus [Ab]in my heart, [Eb]in my heart,
[Eb]Lord, I [Bb]want to [Cm]be more [Ab]like Jesus [Eb]in my [Ab]heart, in [Eb]my heart.
[Eb]In [Ab]my heart, [Eb]in [Cm]my heart,
[Eb]Lord, I [Bb]want to be [Cm]more like Jesus [Ab]in my heart, [Eb]in my heart.
